{"description":"✨ Toronto Social Club is hosting another Girls’ Walk at Yonge & St. Clair on October 3rd, this time in collaboration with Kela! 💕\nAfter our walk, we’ll head to Kela to cool down, catch up, and enjoy some delicious frozen yogurt. 🍦\nAs a special treat, all attendees will receive 15% off a Classic or Grand! There will also be small games and raffle. \n\nLet’s make new friends, walk together, and make the most of the last few beautiful days of the season!\nThe route is mostly flat, with one or two small hills along the way. Please dress accordingly and wear comfortable footwear.\n\n Girls only! \n\nIf you are unable to make it, please cancel your registration.","organizer":"Events!!"}